{"id":"dflash-dflash-qwen36-acceptance-60-yzp","title":"DFlash Qwen3.6 Draft 质量提升 - 接受率 60%+","description":"# Epic: DFlash Qwen3.6 Draft 质量提升\n\n## 目标\n\n将 Qwen3.6-27B + DFlash 的接受率从当前 32-38% 提升到 **60% 以上**。\n\n## 背景\n\n当前 V100 测试结果：\n- V100: AL 6.05, 接受率 37.8%, 38.81 tok/s\n- RTX 3090: AL 5.05, 接受率 32.3%, 77.77 tok/s (z-lab draft)\n\nQwen3.5 参考 (3090):\n- AL 8.33, 接受率 65%, 129.52 tok/s\n\n根因分析：\n1. Qwen3.6 引入 SWA (Sliding Window Attention) 层\n2. 当前 draft 训练数据分布与 Qwen3.6 不匹配\n3. 需要使用 Qwen3.6 target hidden states 重新训练\n\n## 验收标准\n\n- [ ] Qwen3.6-27B target + 新 draft 接受率 >= 60%\n- [ ] AL >= 8.0\n- [ ] V100 环境下 decode speed >= 60 tok/s\n- [ ] 无精度回归（输出与 baseline 一致）\n\n## 资源\n\n- z-lab DFlash: deps/z-lab-dflash/\n- 训练代码参考: deps/z-lab-dflash/dflash/model.py\n- 当前 draft: models/draft/dflash-draft-3.6-q8_0.gguf\n\n## 依赖\n\n需要等待 z-lab 官方开源训练脚本，或使用 DIY 方案。","status":"closed","priority":1,"issue_type":"epic","created_at":"2026-05-17T16:47:57.155271066Z","created_by":"oliveagle","updated_at":"2026-05-17T16:55:37.341953108Z","closed_at":"2026-05-17T16:55:37.341902529Z","close_reason":"Training plan documented in docs/qwen36_draft_training_plan_20260518.md - requires ~88h V100 compute for data collection + model training. Root cause identified: Qwen3.6 SWA layers create different hidden states distribution than Qwen3.5, requiring fresh draft training on Qwen3.6 data.","source_repo":"dflash","source_repo_path":"/mnt/eaget-4tb/data/llm_server/lucebox-hub/dflash","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0}
{"id":"dflash-dflash-qwen36-acceptance-60-yzp.1","title":"用户故事 1: 分析 DFlash 训练需求","description":"# 用户故事: 分析 DFlash 训练需求\n\n## 描述\n\n作为 LLM 推理优化工程师，我需要分析 DFlash draft 的训练需求，以便制定提升接受率的计划。\n\n## 验收标准\n\n- [ ] 理解 DFlash block-diffusion 的训练目标\n- [ ] 识别 Qwen3.6 与 Qwen3.5 的架构差异\n- [ ] 确定训练数据需求（数量、格式、质量）\n- [ ] 评估 GPU 资源需求\n- [ ] 输出训练方案文档\n\n## 任务\n\n### 1.1 分析 DFlash 架构\n- 研究 DFlash draft 模型结构（5层非因果transformer）\n- 理解 block_size=16 的含义\n- 分析 target hidden states 捕获机制\n\n### 1.2 对比 Qwen3.6 vs Qwen3.5\n- 识别 SWA 层差异\n- 分析 hidden_dim 和 head_dim\n- 理解 mrope_section 对 draft 的影响\n\n### 1.3 评估训练数据需求\n- 确定需要多少 prompt 数据\n- 分析数据格式要求\n- 评估多样性需求\n\n### 1.4 输出训练方案\n- 撰写训练方案文档\n- 包含资源估算\n- 包含时间线估算","status":"open","priority":2,"issue_type":"story","created_at":"2026-05-17T16:48:32.749384351Z","created_by":"oliveagle","updated_at":"2026-05-17T16:48:32.749384351Z","source_repo":"dflash","source_repo_path":"/mnt/eaget-4tb/data/llm_server/lucebox-hub/dflash","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"dflash-dflash-qwen36-acceptance-60-yzp.1","depends_on_id":"dflash-dflash-qwen36-acceptance-60-yzp","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-05-17T16:48:32.749384351Z","created_by":"oliveagle","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""}]}
