{"id":"dflash-dflash-qwen36-acceptance-60-yzp.2","title":"用户故事 2: 收集 Qwen3.6 训练数据","description":"# 用户故事: 收集 Qwen3.6 训练数据\n\n## 描述\n\n作为 LLM 推理优化工程师，我需要收集高质量的 Qwen3.6 target hidden states 数据，用于训练更好的 DFlash draft。\n\n## 验收标准\n\n- [ ] 收集 >= 100K prompt-response 对\n- [ ] 覆盖代码、数学、对话、长上下文场景\n- [ ] 捕获 5 个目标层的 hidden states\n- [ ] 数据格式符合训练要求\n- [ ] 数据已保存到本地存储\n\n## 任务\n\n### 2.1 设计数据收集 pipeline\n- 使用 Qwen3.6-27B target 模型\n- 确定 target_layer_ids = [10, 20, 30, 40, 50] (64层模型)\n- 实现 hidden states 捕获机制\n\n### 2.2 收集多样化训练数据\n- HumanEval: 500+ prompts\n- GSM8K/Math500: 500+ prompts\n- 通用对话: 1000+ prompts\n- 长上下文: 100+ prompts (16K+ tokens)\n\n### 2.3 验证数据质量\n- 检查 hidden states 维度正确\n- 验证无 NaN/Inf 值\n- 确保 prompt-response 对完整\n\n### 2.4 保存数据\n- 转换为 safetensors 格式\n- 存储到 models/training_data/\n- 生成 metadata 索引\n\n## 技术参考\n\n参考 deps/z-lab-dflash/dflash/model.py 中的 extract_context_feature 函数。","status":"open","priority":2,"issue_type":"story","created_at":"2026-05-17T16:48:32.811005866Z","created_by":"oliveagle","updated_at":"2026-05-17T16:48:32.811005866Z","source_repo":"dflash","source_repo_path":"/mnt/eaget-4tb/data/llm_server/lucebox-hub/dflash","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"dflash-dflash-qwen36-acceptance-60-yzp.2","depends_on_id":"dflash-dflash-qwen36-acceptance-60-yzp","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-05-17T16:48:32.811005866Z","created_by":"oliveagle","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""}]}
