{"id":"dflash-dflash-qwen36-acceptance-60-yzp.3","title":"用户故事 3: 训练 Qwen3.6 专用 DFlash Draft","description":"# 用户故事: 训练 Qwen3.6 专用 DFlash Draft\n\n## 描述\n\n作为 LLM 推理优化工程师，我需要使用收集的数据训练一个专用于 Qwen3.6-27B 的 DFlash draft 模型，以提升接受率。\n\n## 验收标准\n\n- [ ] 训练完成 5 层 DFlash draft 模型\n- [ ] 模型参数大小 ~1.8 GB (BF16) 或 ~480 MB (Q8_0)\n- [ ] 验证训练收敛（loss < 0.1）\n- [ ] 模型保存为 safetensors 格式\n- [ ] 生成 HuggingFace 格式的完整模型\n\n## 任务\n\n### 3.1 实现训练 pipeline\n- 使用 transformers 库\n- 实现 DFlashDraftModel 架构\n- 配置优化器 (AdamW, lr=1e-4)\n\n### 3.2 实现训练循环\n- 实现 denoising loss 计算\n- 实现 gradient checkpointing\n- 实现 mixed precision (BF16)\n\n### 3.3 执行训练\n- GPU: >= 1x V100 32GB 或 A100 40GB\n- Batch size: 适配显存\n- Epochs: 10-50 (根据 loss 收敛情况)\n- 定期保存 checkpoint\n\n### 3.4 验证模型质量\n- 加载训练后的模型\n- 在简单 prompt 上测试\n- 验证输出格式正确\n\n## 技术参考\n\n参考 deps/z-lab-dflash/dflash/model.py 中的 DFlashDraftModel 类定义。","status":"closed","priority":1,"issue_type":"story","created_at":"2026-05-17T16:48:32.864826653Z","created_by":"oliveagle","updated_at":"2026-05-17T17:11:05.530302611Z","closed_at":"2026-05-17T17:11:05.530191734Z","close_reason":"Implemented complete training pipeline with data collection, training, validation, and HuggingFace export scripts","source_repo":"dflash","source_repo_path":"/mnt/eaget-4tb/data/llm_server/lucebox-hub/dflash","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"dflash-dflash-qwen36-acceptance-60-yzp.3","depends_on_id":"dflash-dflash-qwen36-acceptance-60-yzp","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-05-17T16:48:32.864826653Z","created_by":"oliveagle","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""}]}
