{"id":"dflash-dflash-qwen36-acceptance-60-yzp.4","title":"用户故事 4: 转换并量化 Draft 为 GGUF","description":"# 用户故事: 转换并量化 Draft 为 GGUF\n\n## 描述\n\n作为 LLM 推理优化工程师，我需要将训练好的 DFlash draft 转换为 GGUF 格式并量化，以便在 lucebox-hub/dflash 中使用。\n\n## 验收标准\n\n- [ ] 转换为 GGUF 格式 (arch: qwen35-dflash-draft 或 dflash-draft)\n- [ ] 量化到 Q8_0\n- [ ] 文件大小 ~480 MB\n- [ ] 加载到 lucebox-hub/dflash 无报错\n- [ ] 验证 tensor 维度正确\n\n## 任务\n\n### 4.1 准备转换工具\n- 使用 scripts/convert_dflash_to_gguf.py\n- 验证 gguf-py 依赖\n- 准备 safetensors 输入\n\n### 4.2 执行格式转换\n- 配置 metadata (HIDDEN=5120, N_LAYER=5, HEAD_DIM=128)\n- 添加 DFlash-specific 元数据\n- 输出 GGUF 文件\n\n### 4.3 量化到 Q8_0\n- 使用 scripts/quantize_draft_q8.py\n- 验证量化精度损失 < 1%\n\n### 4.4 验证 GGUF 可用性\n- 加载到 test_dflash\n- 运行 smoke test\n- 验证无内存错误\n\n## 技术参考\n\n参考 scripts/convert_dflash_to_gguf.py 和 scripts/quantize_draft_q8.py。","status":"open","priority":2,"issue_type":"story","created_at":"2026-05-17T16:48:32.918793075Z","created_by":"oliveagle","updated_at":"2026-05-17T16:48:32.918793075Z","source_repo":"dflash","source_repo_path":"/mnt/eaget-4tb/data/llm_server/lucebox-hub/dflash","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"dflash-dflash-qwen36-acceptance-60-yzp.4","depends_on_id":"dflash-dflash-qwen36-acceptance-60-yzp","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-05-17T16:48:32.918793075Z","created_by":"oliveagle","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""}]}
