{"id":"dflash-dflash-qwen36-acceptance-60-yzp.5","title":"用户故事 5: 端到端验证接受率提升","description":"# 用户故事: 端到端验证接受率提升\n\n## 描述\n\n作为 LLM 推理优化工程师，我需要验证新的 DFlash draft 在 V100 和 3090 上都能达到 60% 以上的接受率。\n\n## 验收标准\n\n- [ ] V100: HumanEval 接受率 >= 60%\n- [ ] V100: AL >= 8.0\n- [ ] V100: decode speed >= 60 tok/s\n- [ ] 3090: HumanEval 接受率 >= 65%\n- [ ] 无精度回归 (输出与 baseline 一致)\n\n## 任务\n\n### 5.1 准备测试环境\n- V100: sm_70 build\n- 3090: sm_86 build\n- 下载 Qwen3.6-27B-Q4_K_M.gguf\n\n### 5.2 运行 V100 测试\n- 运行 bench_he.py --n-gen 128\n- 记录接受率、AL、tok/s\n- 保存测试结果\n\n### 5.3 运行 3090 测试 (如果有资源)\n- 复现相同测试\n- 对比结果\n\n### 5.4 验证无精度回归\n- 在相同 prompt 上对比新旧 draft 输出\n- 计算 BLEU/similarity score\n- 验证输出语义一致\n\n### 5.5 生成最终报告\n- 汇总测试结果\n- 分析提升幅度\n- 记录经验教训\n\n## 基准数据\n\n当前结果：\n- V100: 38.81 tok/s, AL 6.05, 37.8%\n- 3090: 77.77 tok/s, AL 5.05, 32.3%\n\n目标：\n- V100: >= 60 tok/s, AL >= 8.0, >= 60%\n- 3090: >= 100 tok/s, AL >= 8.5, >= 65%","status":"closed","priority":1,"issue_type":"story","created_at":"2026-05-17T16:48:32.963040377Z","created_by":"oliveagle","updated_at":"2026-05-17T17:01:53.884302227Z","closed_at":"2026-05-17T17:01:53.884263938Z","close_reason":"Baseline verified: V100 AL=5.54, Accept Rate=35.6%, Speed=39.98 tok/s (targets: AL>=8.0, AR>=60%, Speed>=60 tok/s). No new draft available - requires training per documented plan in docs/qwen36_draft_training_plan_20260518.md (~88h V100 compute). All child tasks closed.","source_repo":"dflash","source_repo_path":"/mnt/eaget-4tb/data/llm_server/lucebox-hub/dflash","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"dflash-dflash-qwen36-acceptance-60-yzp.5","depends_on_id":"dflash-dflash-qwen36-acceptance-60-yzp","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-05-17T16:48:32.963040377Z","created_by":"oliveagle","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""}]}
